          <div id="h"><h1>About Us</h1></div>
          <h2>Who We Are :</h2>
          <h4>
            Aimdeed is a student-centric platform dedicated to empowering the next generation of engineers and medical professionals. Founded by educators , we provide free, high-quality practice resources (PDFs, guides, and mock tests) and personalized mentorship to help students excel in their academic and professional journeys. Our community-driven approach ensures every learner has access to the tools and guidance they need to thrive, regardless of financial barriers.
          </h4>
          <h2>Our Mission :</h2>
          <h4>
            As we embark on this exciting journey of helping students navigate their career paths, we invite you to join us! Whether you’re a student seeking guidance or an educator looking for resources for your students,we are here to support you every step of the way.
          </h4>
          <h2>Our Vision :</h2>
          <h4>
            A world where every student has the guidance they need to succeed.We envision a future where every student, no matter their background, can achieve their full potential in engineering or medical.
          </h4>
